، ومكافحة السايبورغ، والنينجا المنافسين لإسقاط العشيرة التي صنعته.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":8.1}],"value":8.1,"age":"PG-13"},"background_color":"#d9685c","current_season_id":17959,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}